Usage
-----

To use this library in your project, add it to your ols.json collections:

    {
        "collections": [
            {
                "name": "{{name}}",
                "path": "path/to/{{name}}"
            }
        ]
    }

Then import it in your code:

    import "{{name}}:."

Development
-----------

Build the Odin command runner once:

    odin build tools/build.odin -file -out:build

Run checks:

    ./build check

Run tests:

    ./build test

Generate documentation:

    ./build doc

Run the example:

    ./build example
